# UI target: PC by default

When the user asks **any** question or makes **any** request about UI (layout, components, styling, chrome, spacing, etc.):

- Consider **only the PC (desktop) version** — desktop components, breakpoints, and layout.
- Do **not** change, discuss, or optimize mobile UI unless the user **explicitly** refers to mobile (e.g. “mobile”, “phone”, “small screen”).
- When they do explicitly refer to mobile, work on mobile components and layout only for that request.
